  "agent_notes": "Four expenditure outlines (2024-25 to 2021-22).  Capital costs contain user cost of capital (Land and Other assets), debt servicing and depreciation; total capital costs and total expenditure are retained as published subtotals. Net operating expenditure is split by prison security, with a total. Other operating expenditure is a separate excluded-cost block. Totals and components must not be added together. Four detailed reporting years are retained (2024-25 through 2021-22).",
